{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47549","headline":"七言 五十八 · 吕岩","name":"七言 五十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾战蚩尤玉座前，六龙高驾振鸣銮。\n如来车後随金鼓，黄帝旗傍戴铁冠。\n醉捋黑须三岛黯，怒抽霜剑十洲寒。\n轩辕世代横行後，直隐深岩久觅难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}